1
00:00:00,789 --> 00:00:04,079
(Steph:)So we're all standing around
looking at the post-op X-ray...

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:07,460
(Steph:)...and there it is, clear as day,
right in the guy's chest cavity:

3
00:00:07,629 --> 00:00:09,799
(Steph:)One of my earrings.

4
00:00:10,715 --> 00:00:13,345
(Leonard:)Oh, my God, what did you do?

5
00:00:13,510 --> 00:00:14,800
Ha, ha. What do you think I did?

6
00:00:14,969 --> 00:00:16,849
(Steph:)I discreetly slipped off the other earring...

7
00:00:17,013 --> 00:00:19,263
(Steph:)...put it in my pocket,
and then got the hell out of there.

8
00:00:19,432 --> 00:00:20,892
[LAUGHS]

9
00:00:21,059 --> 00:00:23,899
- I have a bone to pick with you, sir.
- Oh!

10
00:00:25,313 --> 00:00:26,983
- Hi, Sheldon.
- Hi, Stephanie.

11
00:00:27,148 --> 00:00:31,778
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry I'm late, but your companion
left the most indecipherable invitation.

12
00:00:31,945 --> 00:00:33,905
(Leonard:)What invitation?

13
00:00:35,115 --> 00:00:36,995
"We're going to the movies."

14
00:00:37,158 --> 00:00:39,828
What movie? What theater? What time?

15
00:00:41,579 --> 00:00:45,579
(Sheldon:)If you were trying to make it impossible to
locate you, you couldn't have done better.

16
00:00:45,750 --> 00:00:48,500
(Leonard:)Oh, clearly, I could have.

17
00:00:49,129 --> 00:00:50,759
It took 20 minutes to go through...

18
00:00:50,922 --> 00:00:55,022
(Sheldon:)...the browser history on your computer
to see what movie times you looked up.

